 "title": "The NGI Forward semantic social network data",
 "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/5576436",
 "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.5576436",
 "description": "<p>The <a href=\"https://research.ngi.eu/\">NGI Forward project</a> is part of the European Union&#39;s <a href=\"https://www.ngi.eu\">Next Generation Internet Initiative</a>. It is meant to provide European institutions with policy advice for how to shape the future, human-centric Internet. As part of it, a team of ethnographers coded a specially convened online conversation, then arranged its results into a semantic social network. This dataset encodes that conversation, as well as the results of the coding exercise, in raw data form for further exploration and replication purposes. The dataset is pseudonymized.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://exchange.ngi.eu/\">Funnel website</a> of the project.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.1177/1525822X20908236\">About semantic social networks</a>.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://edgeryders.eu/t/long-term-ssna-data-storage-documentation-manual/12786\">Data export and documentation process</a> (contains links to the code used to export the data)</li>\n</ul>",
